WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.200
-Amid a torrent
of national outrage

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.200
and widespread protests
over the Supreme Court's

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.234
grotesque decision
to shred abortion rights,

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:10.267
Republicans are shamelessly
claiming that it's Democrats

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:12.567
who are staging riots
by peacefully protesting.

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:13.934
And, on top of that,

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:15.834
they're trying to gaslight
everybody into thinking

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:18.367
nothing has been banned
as a result of this decision.

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:20.634
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:25.267
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:27.534
Tens of thousands
of outraged Americans poured

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:28.734
into the streets
over the weekend

00:00:28.734 --> 00:00:30.467
to channel their grief
and indignation

00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:32.567
over the fact that the right
to bodily autonomy

00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:34.868
of women and pregnant people
was incinerated

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.033
by a corrupt gang
of unaccountable,

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:39.801
right-wing theocrats
who definitely think

00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:42.667
"The Scarlet Letter"
was a comedy, including --

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:44.400
[ Laughter ]
the racist neighbor
who calls the cops

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.033
when your leaves blow
on his lawn,

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:47.300
Mike Pence's son...

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.834
or dad...

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:50.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.267 --> 00:00:52.767
...and the sniveling rich kid
who buys the town rec center

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:54.701
and bulldozes it
to build a luxury condo.

00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:57.000
[ As Kavanaugh ]
You can hold all the
fundraisers you want!

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.067
You'll never
raise enough money

00:00:58.067 --> 00:01:00.200
to save your precious
indoor pool!

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.834
[ Laughter ]
Poll after poll after poll

00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:03.567
has shown that a large majority
of Americans

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:05.167
are opposed to overturning Roe,

00:01:05.167 --> 00:01:06.901
and that majority showed up
in large numbers

00:01:06.901 --> 00:01:10.100
over the weekend in a series
of nationwide protests.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.234
-The decision sent tens
of thousands of people

00:01:13.234 --> 00:01:15.534
into the streets
this weekend to protest.

00:01:15.534 --> 00:01:17.734
-There were nonstop
demonstrations over the weekend

00:01:17.734 --> 00:01:19.367
and they're expected
to continue.

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:23.000
-All day long, the crowds have
been steadily building here

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.801
at Washington Square Park.

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:26.334
Across the nation,

00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:30.033
at least 100 demonstrations
are planned in the coming days.

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:31.834
-I'm most worried
about what comes next

00:01:31.834 --> 00:01:33.434
because Roe v Wade
was a precedent

00:01:33.434 --> 00:01:35.868
for Obergefell v Hodges,
Loving v Virginia,

00:01:35.868 --> 00:01:37.734
Irving v Texas --
gay marriage,

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:40.200
interracial marriage,
and privacy in the bedroom.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.901
And those, as Clarence Thomas
came out yesterday,

00:01:42.901 --> 00:01:44.734
they're going to be falling
like dominoes.

00:01:44.734 --> 00:01:46.133
-Yeah, that's right.
And let me just note,

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:48.133
for a moment, the difference
between the protesters

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:50.801
at a pro-abortion rights rally,
who are deeply familiar

00:01:50.801 --> 00:01:52.601
