00:02:07.234 --> 00:02:08.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.234 --> 00:02:15.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.334 --> 00:02:18.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:20.000
And, yeah, I made sure

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.601
to call it a lectern, this time,

00:02:21.601 --> 00:02:24.734
