the real crime from January 6th.

00:02:30.634 --> 00:02:32.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.901
And let me just say,
as a general rule, that --

00:02:34.901 --> 00:02:36.367
and this is just me speaking --

00:02:36.367 --> 00:02:38.701
it feels like a bad sign
when we have to know

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:41.300
