00:03:10.033 --> 00:03:13.000
-It's wrong
and you know it's wrong.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.801
-Sorry.
Take it up with the court.

00:03:14.801 --> 00:03:16.133
[ Laughter ]
-Ugh!

00:03:16.133 --> 00:03:17.701
This is, suffice it to say,

00:03:17.701 --> 00:03:20.767
