00:09:44.801 --> 00:09:47.434
to bodily autonomy,
purely because it could.

00:09:47.434 --> 00:09:50.434
It's a rogue court that just
cherry-picks the precedents

00:09:50.434 --> 00:09:51.968
and the parts
of the Constitution they like

00:09:51.968 --> 00:09:53.467
and discards
the ones they don't.

00:09:53.467 --> 00:09:56.501
That's it. Their opinions aren't
serious legal documents.

00:09:56.501 --> 00:09:58.334
They're just wordy, judicial...

00:09:58.334 --> 00:09:59.434
-Hissy fits.

00:09:59.434 --> 00:10:00.834
[ Laughter and applause ]
-This has been

00:10:00.834 --> 00:10:01.968
"A Closer Look."

00:10:01.968 --> 00:10:05.667
♪♪

00:10:05.667 --> 00:10:07.234
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:10:07.234 --> 00:10:08.534
over two million meals a year

00:10:08.534 --> 00:10:10.567
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:10:10.567 --> 00:10:12.100
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:14.033
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:10:14.033 --> 00:10:16.167
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:10:16.167 --> 00:10:18.801
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

